{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31345","headline":"覆落後呈同年 · 杨知至","name":"覆落後呈同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"由来梁鴈与冥鸿，不合翩翩向碧空。\n寒谷谩劳邹氏律，长天独遇宋都风。\n此时泣玉情虽异，他日衔环事亦同。\n二月春光正摇荡，无因得醉杏园中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨知至","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}